# Context ignore list for the panel-knowledge-combined image
#
# build.sh rsyncs panel/ (team-memory-control) + knowledge/ (services/knowledge)
# into a temporary context directory, and this file applies in that context.
# Purpose: keep secrets / internal network information / large files out of the image.

# ── Real config: must be mounted at runtime, never in the image ──
# metadata-instances.json contains the wamf kernel Bearer token; see the deployment section of the panel README.
panel/config/metadata-instances.json
panel/config/*.yaml
panel/config/*.yml
panel/.env
panel/.env.*
knowledge/.env
knowledge/.env.*

# ── Docs: not needed at runtime, and contain internal path references ──
# Both docs/ levels are excluded. The only spec needed at runtime is knowledge/openapi.yaml (at the package root,
# read by src/server.ts for Swagger UI), which isn't under docs/ and so is unaffected.
panel/docs/
knowledge/docs/

# ── Test scripts: contain hard-coded internal environment paths, not needed at runtime ──
panel/tests/
panel/e2e-*.sh
knowledge/__tests__/
knowledge/bin/e2e-*.sh

# ── dependencies / build output ──
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/.git
**/logs
**/*.log
**/data/
**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal
**/*.sqlite

# ── editor/OS clutter ──
**/.DS_Store
**/.idea/
**/.vscode/
**/*.swp
**/*.swo
**/.iwiki
**/.codebuddy
